{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "594954fcbe1f31bf4672ded0b7b69cd7f41f04d7e19cd66495acb0838f128f85", "ja": "清涼飲料水のCM撮影　休憩中", "zh": "拍摄清凉饮料广告　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5000_place", "source_sha256": "dc6e2aafeb9e125b69d1b143f05c66414e6e1a4f46c163a52a6d289efeef27c7", "ja": "学校", "zh": "学校", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5001_p", "source_sha256": "2ce94156b4c889075f4a73fee2c9289ee6aadc9aebfe7905d2872cfc04c882f6", "ja": "（今回は、清涼飲料水のCM撮影だ。初恋の\n甘酸っぱさがテーマで、ここまで順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（这次要拍摄清凉饮料的广告。主题是初恋的酸甜滋味，目前进展得很顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5002_003mik", "source_sha256": "5abf6df359d745ab83b323612bf69a6457fc0186093c88f5799eaea8606bd8cc", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}は\n先輩と後輩、どっちに告白されたい？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}是想被前辈告白，还是后辈告白？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5003_p", "source_sha256": "e2d4defb0b8976685622c231578eff412d317ff102d866cb8985aa9bb13ae8bf", "ja": "えっ、なんだ急に……。\nもうちょっと詳しく。", "zh": "诶，怎么突然问这个……  \n再说详细一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5004_003mik", "source_sha256": "c105bdd2af99304d25ac649f575781402eae1a6332fc7e48409da766275b32e8", "ja": "えっとね。この後、ミキが告白するシーン、撮る\nでしょ？　カメラに向かって、「好き」っていうの。", "zh": "那个……接下来要拍美希告白的场景，对吧？就是对着镜头说“喜欢你”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5005_003mik", "source_sha256": "fac9bd0c28ed3c6cc0aadd175b0a192d27512bff0e41e3cc94f05c2c3dc1ca6e", "ja": "その時に、どんな感じで告白するか迷ってるの。\n監督と相談してるんだけど、なかなか決まらなくて。", "zh": "我在犹豫到时候该用什么感觉来告白。\n虽然正在和导演商量，却一直没能定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5006_p", "source_sha256": "a62bde7f632b8b48fcc194e72905d87573ff15f3c55fc6985b2232a518ee58b0", "ja": "なるほど、このCMで一番重要なところだな。\nそれなら……。", "zh": "原来如此，这是这支广告最重要的地方啊。\n既然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5007", "source_sha256": "d24c68b3032dab5f53539225a18003b9cdb8a5dc06aa65172907abaf0d27b529", "ja": "先輩っぽく", "zh": "像前辈一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5008", "source_sha256": "409ca61c3b07c7584fe77264c4d29d0f4eb5c655dfae3f2e428cac27f42193e7", "ja": "後輩っぽく", "zh": "像后辈一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5200_p", "source_sha256": "f2d15627394f5ccd0a5b25bb7554f4319c9f020df2075e8fc8413b215cdc2541", "ja": "先輩っぽく告白してみるのはどうかな。", "zh": "像学姐一样告白看看，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5201_003mik", "source_sha256": "b31563309971d6435b2af43852f7a08e2d8dd6cedddb1ce11c1d0871a797ba90", "ja": "先輩っぽくってことは、{$P$}、少し\nお姉さんなミキが好きなの？　ちょっとやってみるね。", "zh": "既然要像前辈一样，也就是说，{$P$}先生喜欢稍微像姐姐一样的美希吗？　我来试试看哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5202_003mik", "source_sha256": "472214aafbcb959a5d6d85d6c32150547c1c90baac1ccc118c625a87d0af01e9", "ja": "「後輩くんのこと、ずっと好きだったんだ……」\nあはっ☆　なんだか楽しくなってきたの！", "zh": "“其实，我一直都喜欢着学弟你呢……”\n啊哈☆　总觉得越来越好玩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5300_p", "source_sha256": "f2d15627394f5ccd0a5b25bb7554f4319c9f020df2075e8fc8413b215cdc2541", "ja": "先輩っぽく告白してみるのはどうかな。", "zh": "像学姐一样告白看看，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5301_003mik", "source_sha256": "b55fa8ef74aab676baabc95bd104a12d20eb3077e88da47b76d0bd32e0ec953e", "ja": "先輩っぽくかぁ。ミキ、たくさん告白はされるけど、\n自分からってないから……ちょっと真似してみるね。", "zh": "像前辈那样吗？美希虽然经常被人告白，但还从来没有主动告白过……所以，稍微模仿一下试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5302_003mik", "source_sha256": "48256de8fee22ba7649a91e54a48c940525040522d083527380126141f93d85b", "ja": "「オレたち、付き合おうぜ……な？」\n……男の子の告白になっちゃった！　これでいい？", "zh": "“我们交往吧……好不好？”\n……变成男孩子的告白了！这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5500_p", "source_sha256": "fa5f6fcb176b89049e6b9fd611dbc42b0747567109219caefc84f7181c38a003", "ja": "後輩っぽく告白するのはどうだ？", "zh": "像后辈那样告白怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5501_003mik", "source_sha256": "3c4b6024012c5ea0f4c2be56836cf65b542da806dfb94b189ccbab2112779ef9", "ja": "うーん。ミキが後輩ってことは、カメラの向こうにいる\nミキの好きな人って、年上だよね？", "zh": "嗯——既然美希是后辈，那镜头另一边美希喜欢的人，就是年长的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5503_003mik", "source_sha256": "86111bc71e9f12d3fabb0f6fd5f0da0e736f53e526049055d932ef9a4fbf57c6", "ja": "だったら……{$P$}がカメラ持って\nくれたら、カンタンだと思うな！　よろしくなの～☆", "zh": "那样的话……要是{$P$}拿着摄像机，应该就简单多了！拜托啦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5600_p", "source_sha256": "fa5f6fcb176b89049e6b9fd611dbc42b0747567109219caefc84f7181c38a003", "ja": "後輩っぽく告白するのはどうだ？", "zh": "像后辈那样告白怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5601_003mik", "source_sha256": "2498047195597f894539a849574bbbb0181c450cfba61e78ecdfb022d0ea1a82", "ja": "カワイイ感じの告白がいいってカンジ？\nミキ、それならすぐできそうなの。", "zh": "想要可爱风格的告白，对吧？\n这种事美希好像马上就能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_5602_003mik", "source_sha256": "bd36868ddb364930e54555a5fc9f32239d23ba4d17a40b5781e8c5e5df338454", "ja": "カメラに向かって、上目遣いで……「先輩、大好き！」\nって。{$P$}、ドキドキした？", "zh": "对着镜头，抬眼看着……“前辈，我最喜欢你了！”这样。{$P$}，有没有心跳加速？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
